{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5fed10c3ec3a9f1aa5457ffed29e4af573fcd3a9a26df2dc2872437f6d860814","ja":"百合子の決意","zh":"百合子的决心","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ff6c452c654c3fc85e620c8eece83adff322ce0d49d82beed9caf9d17f77f862","ja":"今日のお仕事は生放送のTV番組。番組は順調に進み、\n後は映画の告知だけになったけど……","zh":"今天的工作是电视节目的现场直播。节目顺利进行着，\n接下来就只剩电影的宣传了，可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d4feecdd96106289a4f92f460da70bea4c265f115fcf38f3e0c2ed205f4836c3","ja":"……それに、人間関係も見どころなんです！\n医者の有馬先生と看護師の祥子さんとか……。","zh":"……而且，人际关系也是一大看点！\n比如身为医生的有马医生和护士祥子小姐……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fd87d9c67b27ae3b6a675c31dcfb5687f827a03f807a4dbab07ca6120c5dc5b4","ja":"そこに犯人の思惑が絡んで物語が進行していくん\nですけど、まず何よりもお伝えしたいのが……。","zh":"凶手的企图也会交织其中，推动故事不断展开，\n不过，首先最想传达给大家的是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cb02841ccf1cd6666d20f45291795b6ada6101f7a8e38c245026a21a851a1f56","ja":"ね、ねえ、百合子ちゃん。楽しそうにお話ししてる\nところ悪いんだけど……そろそろ時間が……。","zh":"那个，百合子。虽然在你聊得这么开心的时候\n打扰你很不好意思……不过差不多该到时间了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3c1aa64c5cd8752ee1aea82ed397a602ecf3d38d425854cad6dc2950e732205d","ja":"ええっ！　もう終わりなんですか！？\nだって、まだまだ話したいことが……。","zh":"诶！已经结束了吗！？\n可是，明明还有好多想聊的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5706b9bd92451e0bddef0ac79f13d43c94969139f434e13ac9a400087f39f908","ja":"とても見応えのある映画なので、\nぜひ映画館まで見に来てください。それでは。","zh":"这是一部非常值得一看的电影，\n请务必前往电影院观看。那么再见。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"95e380476f311b73c38ac52086db5be4c83c44f9d0a22aba2c0c9d56ee17493e","ja":"ごめんなさい！　私がしゃべりすぎたせいで、\nみなさんの話す時間がなくなっちゃって……。","zh":"对不起！都怪我说得太多，\n害得大家说话的时间都没了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e2bc3b31bcddfde300d08be42e503ed04a94ace99102e146c2ed206d84882e36","ja":"全然大丈夫だよ！\n映画の宣伝はできたんだし。","zh":"完全没关系的！\n毕竟电影的宣传也做到了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"7b3b82e72e2ba9c3a4060666caa300f6e966bd5aa792bdc47baeefc6154ee1d7","ja":"でも、宣伝の途中で番組が終わってしまいましたし、\nこれからは気をつけた方がいいですよね。","zh":"不过，宣传途中节目就结束了，\n今后还是注意一点比较好吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"d39f874fb27fab42d5227a73e2647df3927a9941e702f7cc24511aa751d5a1b6","ja":"そこが百合子ちゃんの\nいいところでもあるんだけどね。","zh":"但这也就是百合子的\n优点所在呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"7930b518006cba43408e6d8026a42eff774a986a2c04c9d145a10b6d20b76729","ja":"琴葉さん、ありがとうございます。でも、志保の\n言うとおり、このままではいけないと思うんです……。","zh":"琴叶小姐，谢谢你。但是，我觉得正如志保\n所说的那样，再这样下去是不行的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"1bcbfffdc1ab2597e7b99ef6fa0d43b7808b425f532096d2cab232a51a632354","ja":"だから私、次の生放送までに、\n映画の魅力を短く伝えられるようにまとめてきます！","zh":"所以，在下次直播之前，\n我会把电影的魅力精练地总结出来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"c332921aa4eca5be1623a4787c48920063a50e84f6717dfa532eb32803b976ca","ja":"そこまでしなくても……。\n時間が必要なら、私たちのを使えばいいのよ。","zh":"用不着做到那种地步……\n如果需要时间的话，用我们的不就好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1356.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"85a378f1e2339e973875d25aa4a3f6b43840863c27de61da3ab9f8c0802f8f7f","ja":"いえ、これ以上、\n迷惑をかけるわけにはいきませんから！","zh":"不，我不能再\n给您添麻烦了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
